" :answer/value "true"] [:db/ensure "ee5cc371-1e31-5af0-b590-b0e123a69dca" :answer/validate] [:db/add "121ca29b-ff12-50d2-a3bf-d408737a7afb" :answer-field/id #uuid "121ca29b-ff12-50d2-a3bf-d408737a7afb"] [:db/add "121ca29b-ff12-50d2-a3bf-d408737a7afb" :answer-field/key "III"] [:db/add "121ca29b-ff12-50d2-a3bf-d408737a7afb" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox] [:db/add "121ca29b-ff12-50d2-a3bf-d408737a7afb" :answer-field/choices "5cc87408-521e-5ff3-81ad-d12b8336cba2"] [:db/add "121ca29b-ff12-50d2-a3bf-d408737a7afb" :answer-field/choices "ee5cc371-1e31-5af0-b590-b0e123a69dca"] [:db/add "121ca29b-ff12-50d2-a3bf-d408737a7afb" :answer-field/correct "5cc87408-521e-5ff3-81ad-d12b8336cba2"] [:db/ensure "121ca29b-ff12-50d2-a3bf-d408737a7afb" :answer-field/validate] [:db/add "d568f072-4f2d-5062-9df6-070b49ac30ab" :question/id #uuid "d568f072-4f2d-5062-9df6-070b49ac30ab"] [:db/add "d568f072-4f2d-5062-9df6-070b49ac30ab" :question/problem "Consider the following differential equation.\n\n$$\ny\\prime=- 5 \\sin{\\left(4 x \\right)}\n$$\n\nLet $f(x)=\\cos{\\left(4 x \\right)}.$ Which of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $f\\prime(x)=- 2 \\sin{\\left(4 x \\right)}.$\n- **II.** Substituting $y=f(x)$ and $y\\prime=f\\prime(x)$ into the differential equation gives a true statement.\n- **III.** The function $y=f(x)$ is a solution of the differential equation."] [:db/add "d568f072-4f2d-5062-9df6-070b49ac30ab" :question/worked-solution "For a function $f(x)$ to be a solution to a differential equation, it must satisfy the equation for all values of $x$ in an interval where the function is defined and the equation is valid.\n\nWith that in mind, let's check each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement I is false. Differentiating $f(x)=\\cos{\\left(4 x \\right)},$ we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}f\\prime(x)&=\\left(\\cos{\\left(4 x \\right)}\\right)\\prime \\\\ &=-\\sin(4x)\\cdot 4 \\\\ &=- 4 \\sin{\\left(4 x \\right)} \\\\ &\\not\\equiv - 2 \\sin{\\left(4 x \\right)}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement II is false. Substituting $y=\\cos{\\left(4 x \\right)}$ and $y\\prime=- 4 \\sin{\\left(4 x \\right)}$ into the original equation gives expressions that are not identical:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y\\prime &\\overset{?}{=}- 5 \\sin{\\left(4 x \\right)} \\\\ - 4 \\sin{\\left(4 x \\right)} &\\not\\equiv - 5 \\sin{\\left(4 x \\right)}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement III is false. Since statement II is false, the function $y=\\cos{\\left(4 x \\right)}$ is not a solution to our differential equation.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"None.\""] [:db/add "d568f072-4f2d-5062-9df6-070b49ac30ab" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] [:db/add "d568f072-4f2d-5062-9df6-070b49ac30ab" :question/answer-fields "2a41cff6-b393-54f3-8621-68b284e47ac3"] [:db/add "d568f072-4f2d-5062-9df6-070b49ac30ab" :question/answer-fields "f98785b4-f724-5466-bb66-b99672465add"] [:db/add "d568f072-4f2d-5062-9df6-070b49ac30ab" :question/answer-fields "121ca29b-ff12-50d2-a3bf-d408737a7afb"] [:db/ensure "d568f072-4f2d-5062-9df6-070b49ac30ab" :question/validate] [:db/add 17592186100888 :knowledge-point/questions "d568f072-4f2d-5062-9df6-070b49ac30ab"] [:db/add "5f89bbee-f608-509b-809c-754a660a177f" :answer/id #uuid "5f89bbee-f608-509b-809c-754a660a177f"] [:db/add "5f89bbee-f608-509b-809c-754a660a177f" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "5f89bbee-f608-509b-809c-754a660a177f" :answer/value "false"] [:db/ensure "5f89bbee-f608-509b-809c-754a660a177f" :answer/validate] [:db/add "93c10b1d-09b9-596a-91ee-b34e3f0aeb22" :answer/id #uuid "93c10b1d-09b9-596a-91ee-b34e3f0aeb22"] [:db/add "93c10b1d-09b9-596a-91ee-b34e3f0aeb22" :answer/type :answer.type/text] [:db/add "93c10b1d-09b9-596a-91ee-b34e3f0aeb22" :answer/value "true"] [:db/ensure "93c10b1d-09b9-596a-91ee-b34e3f0aeb22" :answer/validate] [:db/add "b30d6233-d2d5-5248-b659-81906ac6d588" :answer-field/id #uuid "b30d6233-d2d5-5248-b659-81906ac6d588"] [:db/add "b30d6233-d2d5-5248-b659-81906ac6d5